OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to 49 child sex
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to 49 child
OL,7,Fsex offences, which include sexual
OL,8,Factivity with children and taking and
OL,9,Fdistributing indecent photos.
OL,11,FMark South, a Jamaican national from
OL,12,FAshford in Kent, crossed county borders
OL,13,Fto target his victims, who he offered
OL,14,Fitems like vapes and trainers in
OL,15,Fexchange for sexual acts.
OL,17,FPolice were alerted to his behaviour
OL,18,Fafter a safeguarding officer at a
OL,19,Fschool in Swindon, Wiltshire, raised
OL,20,Fthe alarm.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
